                (name: "14th NZ Light AA Regt a = The division was originally known simply as the New Zealand Division. The New Zealand Division was sent to Greece and thence tọ Crete in the spring of 1941. It returned to Egypt with the 5th NZ Brigade and some support units) in early June 1941 where it was reformed, being placed back in action in August 1941. The division was again withdrawn in March 1942 to Syria, returning in June 1942. The 4th NZ Brigade was eventually withdrawn again in September 1942, to be refitted as an armored brigade. b=The 5th New Zealand Brigade (plus the 7th New Zealand Anti- tank Regiment and the 5th New Zealand Field Artillery Regiment) actually arrived in March 1941. However, they were shipped im- mediately to Greece. They started service in North Africa in August", abbr: "14 NZ Lt", id: "ee", comp: Weapons([("Light AA", 6)]), org_size: Division, arrival: Turn(game_turn: 35, stage: 1), parent: ""),
